OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fmostly dry this evening and overnight,
OL,7,Fbut spots of rain and drizzle are
OL,8,Fpossible at times. Gales are possible
OL,9,Fin the far northwest and rather
OL,10,Fblustery elsewhere. Very mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FLargely cloudy and rather
OL,13,Fwindy with rain edging into the
OL,14,Fnorthwest through the morning and
OL,15,Fcontinuing slowly southeast through
OL,16,Fthe afternoon. Very mild and feeling
OL,17,Funseasonably warm in any brightness.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
