OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain on
OL,6,FThursday night clearing south, then
OL,7,Fcolder on Friday with sunny spells and
OL,8,Fpossible showers. Settled and largely
OL,9,Fdry thereafter with some sunshine and
OL,10,Fcold, locally frosty nights.
